          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Plug it into an outdoor GFCI outlet, use dry chips in small amounts, and keep the door closed. Do those three things and an electric smoker will make some of the easiest good barbecue you have cooked.
